<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issue.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Friday that on December 2 it will redeem the entire $50 million principal amount of its 6.845 percent debentures due April 2, 2001.</p>
<p>The cusip number for the debenture series is 3134A0ZQ8.</p>
<p>Freddie Mac said it will redeem the debentures in their entirety at a price equal to 100 percent of principal. It will pay principal plus accrued interest to the redemption date to holders of record as of the close of business on November 29.</p>
</text>
